    "note": "Published from main d2a5bf6 with blast_acl_root set to the deployer, which is this commit. Fresh publication of the presale stack that signs in through the shared blast_admin ACL (contracts #80). blast_admin and blast_partners were published with sui/{admin,partners}/scripts/publish_immutable.sh; blast_presale with sui/presale/scripts/publish.sh and sealed with wrap_package_admin.sh. The Aftermath vendor's publish_immutable.sh failed on chain with PublishUpgradeMissingDependency (digest 3rzskkSq\u2026, gas only): its interface stubs declare no dependencies, so the CLI omitted the Aftermath AMM and DAO-fee packages' own linkage. It was published from its --dump-bytecode-as-base64 build with that linkage added (aftermathTransitiveDependencies) and made immutable in the same PTB."
  },
